        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As an integral part of our transportation services, we also provide a wide range of value-added logistics services, such as freight consolidation, drop trailer, cross-border logistics, customs brokerage and trade compliance, supply chain consulting and design, and fully managed third-party logistics (“3PL”) and fourth-party logistics (“4PL”) solutions.",
        "start_character": 2975,
        "end_character": 3329
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For most of our transportation and logistics services, we are a service provider.",
        "start_character": 9721,
        "end_character": 9802
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to transportation and logistics services, we also provide sourcing services under the trade name Robinson Fresh® (“Robinson Fresh”).",
        "start_character": 3672,
        "end_character": 3816
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide fee-based Managed Solutions, warehousing services, and other services.",
        "start_character": 8703,
        "end_character": 8797
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Managed Solutions business, we are often acting as the shipper’s agent.",
        "start_character": 10207,
        "end_character": 10285
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our breadth of value-added services also includes supply chain consulting and design, analytics, customs brokerage and compliance, project logistics, warehousing, and cargo insurance—for which we are usually paid separately.",
        "start_character": 12872,
        "end_character": 13096
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To make it easier for contracted motor carriers to work with us, we send hyper-customized load recommendations to them directly, give them simple tools to make offers and instantly book loads, and provide financial services that make it easier to get paid.",
        "start_character": 26565,
        "end_character": 26821
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also buy from and sell transportation services to companies that compete with us.",
        "start_character": 17575,
        "end_character": 17659
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete against traditional and non-traditional logistics companies, including transportation providers that own equipment, third-party freight brokers, technology matching services, internet freight brokers, carriers offering logistics services, on-demand transportation service providers, NVOCCs, IACs, and freight forwarders.",
        "start_character": 17243,
        "end_character": 17574
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continually work on establishing contractual relationships with qualified transportation providers that meet both our and our customers’ service requirements to provide dependable services, favorable pricing, and available capacity during periods when demand for transportation equipment is greater than the supply.",
        "start_character": 25674,
        "end_character": 25992
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We execute these services by investing in and retaining talented employees, developing innovative proprietary systems and processes, and utilizing a network of contracted transportation providers, including, but not limited to, contracted motor carriers, railroads, and ocean and air carriers.",
        "start_character": 6416,
        "end_character": 6709
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001043277-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001043277-26-000009-57de1b9dcf374eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001043277-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We grow and develop leaders and employees by offering opportunities for early-career talent and seasoned experts to work on complex, strategic projects that shape global supply chains and deliver value for some of the world’s largest companies.",
        "start_character": 40866,
        "end_character": 41110
      }
